$x+y = 2k-x-y \implies x+y=k$.
So boundary.
So the region is $x \le k, y \le k, x+y \le k$.
Area $k^2/2$. Integral $1/6$.
Correct.

So total volume = $1 (all+) + 1 (all-) + 3 \times 1/6 (2+) + 3 \times 1/6 (2-)$.
$= 2 + 0.5 + 0.5 = 3$.
