  - Verify specialized-tool outputs independently by recomputation or back-substitution.
- Use problem-specific tools (if provided) to get a candidate answer quickly, then verify with python_eval or by direct substitution if the tool is not obviously authoritative.
- If a tool returns an empty or implausible result, inspect and correct your logic (e.g., remove invalid filters like gcd(a*b*c) != 1) and rerun.

Finish only when
