The dot product is $\hat{n} \cdot \hat{N} = \frac{x+y+z}{\sqrt{3}}$.
Since $x,y,z \ge 0$ on the eighth-sphere, $x+y+z \ge 0$, so the absolute value is redundant.
Thus, $A_{proj} = \iint_S \frac{x+y+z}{\sqrt{3}} \, dA$.
