Thus, $dp[k][i] = \sum_{p=1}^{i-1} dp[k-1][p]$ for $i \ge 2k-1$, and $dp[k][i] = 0$ otherwise.
We sum $dp[k][i]$ over all $k$ and $i$ to get the total count.
